# Generated at build time by scripts/embed-js.js from js/intl.js.
#
# Deliberately NOT checked in. QuickJS bytecode is loadable only by the engine
# build that produced it, so a committed blob is a silent trap the first time
# the vendored engine moves: it would either be rejected at load (best case,
# and the module falls back to source) or, if BC_VERSION happened not to change
# while the format did, be undefined behaviour. Regenerating it is one command
# and both build systems run it.
cpp/generated/
